        "original_id": "78d31264-e893-5187-96a6-1c42f2c952ad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Seal\n- Products: Seal (1994 album), \"Kiss from a Rose\"\n- Events: 1996 Grammy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Seal is the singer of the 1994 studio album Seal, which is his second eponymous studio album and is sometimes called Seal II to distinguish it from his 1991 album of the same name.\n- At the 1996 Grammy Awards, \"Kiss from a Rose\" won Record of the Year, Song of the Year, and Best Male Pop Vocal Performance.",
